{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9e4146cd0566ad191d7d7b69e991bd39d7b808a9d12d4a9834f03288bf2f490d", "ja": "気に入ってもらえてよかった。\nブログでも、評判いいみたいだな。", "zh": "你喜欢就好。\n在部落格上好像也颇受好评呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "93986d70b6cfbf32d650d06fccb2f23136e532105282e9998521cf779a6b6004", "ja": "はい～。家族にも見せたんですけど、\nとっても似合ってるって言ってくれました～。", "zh": "是啊～我也让家人看过了，\n他们说我穿起来很好看～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "4615d3efb9dd698d8c81ec0eb680fe558c7b818642d6a1bd6d6759a3288e8372", "ja": "ご近所のおじいちゃん達も、私のブログを\n見るために、スマホを買ったんだそうです～。", "zh": "住在附近的老爷爷们，\n好像还为了看我的部落格，买了智慧型手机～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1006_p", "source_sha256": "639028158b52fa9bcd182f073eca38e00d842f9d9945eee8ee4e120dcae52ca0", "ja": "なるほど……\nだから古風なコメントが多かったのか……。", "zh": "原来如此……\n所以才有那么多古早味留言啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "05e9261d27483596b2f632b75172236aeea37aec8a16b0e3abe93bdcd801f91f", "ja": "今度、ご近所のみなさんで、ツアーを組んで、\n劇場にライブを見に来てくれるそうです～。", "zh": "听说下次附近邻居们\n要组团一起来剧场看演唱会～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "fc0f7cfce115d18ad82b4c9e47d651d8617db8348bf132b6166c8d657b1ac4b8", "ja": "コンサートライトの振り方も、公園で\n練習してるんだそうですよ～。今から楽しみですね～。", "zh": "他们好像还在公园练习挥萤光棒～\n我现在就好期待啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f3f97cdb296cdf9743c2318928a2124cb1106cb0edda6674c97ff0d45cb5ba89", "ja": "そうなのか……。じゃあ当日は俺も、美也ファンの\nおじいちゃん達が楽しめるようにしておかないとな。", "zh": "这样啊……那么当天，\n我也得让美也的老爷爷粉丝们尽兴才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1010_p", "source_sha256": "724afc9e15268d22298b7bb2fa0fe381f551f9a9b7406accb1d308a01174f2bb", "ja": "やっぱり、座布団とかあった方がいいかな。\n席は通路に近い、見やすいところで……。", "zh": "果然该准备坐垫才对吗？\n座位就选在靠近走道，容易看清楚的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "e87eb80fd8d1704c9c768918fbd037d82aab961c01dc1a691f1bfc096b3e516f", "ja": "おおー。さすが、{$P$}さんです～。\nかゆいところに手が届きますな～。", "zh": "喔喔～不愧是{$P$}先生～\n真是无微不至呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "c283f95b446d481a8514279b38ac59565f725dc7df4362f18f181a4a6a2daa46", "ja": "では私も、みなさんの期待に負けないように、\nもっともっとレッスンを頑張らなくては～。", "zh": "那么为了不辜负大家期待，\n我也得更加更加努力训练才行～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dfe985d26d7f8fcbed3f743e8be418cecda306d3fcec9fffa39df7fc907f2949", "ja": "そうだな。\nじゃあその時に向けて、頑張ろうな、美也。", "zh": "是啊。\n为了迎接那一天，好好加油吧，美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0034_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "a19d783a151bf4cb15a263dc620c1e78a26a2529f57c730a86a0fe8bda2f6585", "ja": "はい～。一緒に頑張りましょうね、\n{$P$}さん～。ふふふ。", "zh": "是～一起加油吧，\n{$P$}先生～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
